  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit of internal control system (ISK) of DDF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Audit of internal control system (ISK) of DDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta uppdrag kommer prim&#xe4;rt att fokusera p&#xe5; en analys av ORG:s interna kontrollsystem f&#xf6;r att avg&#xf6;ra om dessa kan garantera kvalitet och noggrannhet i hela organisationskedjan. Uppdraget omfattar en granskning d&#xe4;r rutiner och system f&#xf6;r operativ och ekonomisk kontroll beskrivs och analyseras. Dessutom ska konsulten l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer avseende f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar som bed&#xf6;ms n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment will primarily focus on an analysis of the ORG&#x2019;s internal control systems in order to determine whether these can guarantee quality and accuracy in the entire organizational chain. The assignment includes a review in which routines and systems for operational and financial control are described and analysed. In addition, the consultant shall submit recommendations in respect of improvements deemed necessary.</narrative>
  </description>
